&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal and Private Banking - Consumer Channel &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cape Town Nothern Suburbs, Somerset West and Stellenbosch  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
