&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:18.9px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#006341&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;b&gt;Please contact the Nedbank Recruiting Team at +27 860 555 566&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;img id=&quot;Picture_x0020_1&quot; src=&quot;https://rmkcdn.successfactors.com/dd82a348/461743ac-ca78-42fa-8634-a.png&quot; style=&quot;height:255.0px;width:600.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:18.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Job Classification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Infrastructure Designer(145757)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Closing date: 27 July 2026&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Job Family&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Information Technology&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Career Stream&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;It Architecture&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Leadership Pipeline&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Manage Self: Technical&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Job Purpose&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Infrastructure Designer is accountable for the end-to-end design, governance, and architectural assurance of secure, resilient, and compliant cloud and hybrid infrastructure solutions within Nedbank’s Movement of Value environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is pivotal to cloud adoption, payment system modernisation, and regulatory compliance, ensuring that innovation is delivered within Nedbank’s defined risk appetite, security posture, and operational resilience standards. The Infrastructure Designer acts as a trusted design authority, balancing engineering enablement with control, assurance, and long-term sustainability&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Architecture Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and define infrastructure architecture designs aligned to Nedbank enterprise standards, reference architectures, and strategic roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure design consistency across cloud, hybrid, and on-premises environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud, Hybrid &amp;amp; Data Centre Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design scalable and secure cloud, hybrid, and data centre infrastructure solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define integration patterns covering networking, identity, compute, storage, and platform services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance by Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed security, risk, and regulatory controls by design, ensuring compliance with banking, payments, and data protection requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Risk, Security, and Compliance functions throughout the design lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Resilience &amp;amp; Availability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design infrastructure to meet availability, performance, disaster recovery, and recoverability requirements for critical banking platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment with Nedbank resilience frameworks and regulatory expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Governance, Cost &amp;amp; Financial Controls&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design infrastructure aligned to cloud financial management (FinOps) principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure cost transparency, optimisation, and governance for cloud consumption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery Assurance &amp;amp; Controlled Engineering Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide architectural assurance across delivery initiatives, enabling teams while maintaining control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve infrastructure designs, deviations, and risk treatments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture Governance &amp;amp; Design Authority&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a &lt;strong&gt;design authority&lt;/strong&gt; within formal architecture governance forums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support architecture reviews, risk assessments, and executive decision-making processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Engagement &amp;amp; Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with business, technology, risk, and delivery stakeholders as a trusted infrastructure advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly articulate design decisions, trade-offs, and risk implications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investment Approval (IA) Preparation &amp;amp; Costing Enquiries&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support investment approval submissions, including infrastructure design justification and cost estimates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to costing and feasibility enquiries with clarity and accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Domain Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing enterprise-scale infrastructure within Nedbank or equivalent large financial institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;circle&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud networking, segmentation, and identity management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure compute, storage, and backup solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid connectivity and data centre integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience implementing&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;control-driven cloud environments&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;aligned to banking standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Architecture Capability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of technology risk management in a regulated banking environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working with:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;circle&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formal architecture governance structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk assessments, risk referrals, and control validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal Audit and Regulatory stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to design for non-functional requirements, including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;circle&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilience and high availability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disaster recovery and recoverability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regulatory and compliance obligations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Essential Qualifications - NQF Level&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0;margin-bottom:0.0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Matric / Grade 12 / National Senior Certificate&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Advanced Diplomas/National 1st Degrees&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Essential Certifications&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0;margin-bottom:0.0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Certificate in infrastructure discipline 
Relevant Industry Technical certifications
ITIL - Proficient 
TOGAF - Proficient&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Preferred Certifications&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft Certified: Azure Solutions Architect Expert&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS Certified Solutions Architect – Professional&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TOGAF or equivalent enterprise architecture certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud security certifications such as CCSP or CISSP (advantageous)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Minimum Experience Level&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;8–12+ year in an IT environment. At least 2 years in a infrastructure specialised environment (WINTEL, UNIX, MAINFRAME) with design experience or cloud architecture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Technical / Professional Knowledge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0;margin-bottom:0.0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Administrative procedures and systems&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Banking knowledge&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Banking procedures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Business principles&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Business terms and definitions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Data analysis&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Governance, Risk and Controls&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Relevant regulatory knowledge&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Relevant software and systems knowledge&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Business writing skills&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Cluster Specific Operational Knowledge&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Project Management&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;System Development Life cycle(SDLC)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Single IT product knowledge&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Multiple operating system&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Unified Modelling Language (UML)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rational application developer&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rational design toolset application&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Behavioural Competencies&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0;margin-bottom:0.0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Continuous Learning&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Collaborating&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Customer Focus&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Initiating Action&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Work Standards&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Managing Work&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Technical/Professional Knowledge and Skills&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:18.9px&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;228&quot; src=&quot;https://rmkcdn.successfactors.com/dd82a348/61ad7a3f-eb85-4980-a04c-e.jpg&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0px;width:600.0px&quot; width=&quot;245&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:18.9px&quot;&gt;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:18.9px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#006341&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;b&gt;Please contact the Nedbank Recruiting Team at +27 860 555 566 &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;img id=&quot;Picture_x0020_1&quot; src=&quot;https://rmkcdn.successfactors.com/dd82a348/461743ac-ca78-42fa-8634-a.png&quot; style=&quot;height:255.0px;width:600.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Job Requisition Details&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Requisition ID: 146786&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Johannesburg, Gauteng&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Closing Date: 22 July 2026&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Talent Acquisition: Bongiwe Mchunu&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Job Family&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Business and Commercial Banking - Finance&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Career Stream&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Accounting&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Leadership Pipeline&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Manage Self: Professional&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;FAIS Affected&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Job Purpose&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;To generate, analyse and report reliable, meaningful financial and non-financial information to support the requirements and decision making of the business, in line with Nedbank’s strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Why Join Our Team&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Join Nedbank and become part of a high-performing Finance team that plays a critical role in shaping business decisions across the Business and Commercial Banking cluster. This role offers the opportunity to work closely with senior stakeholders, influence strategic financial planning, and provide meaningful insights that drive business performance. You&apos;ll gain exposure to budgeting, forecasting, financial analysis, management reporting, and governance processes while developing your professional expertise within one of South Africa&apos;s leading financial institutions. At Nedbank, we are committed to fostering a culture of continuous learning, innovation, transformation, and collaboration, empowering our employees to grow their careers and make a lasting impact.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and consolidate monthly flash reports for the cluster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compare flash results performance to various budget figures and measure growth against previous periods by performing a variance analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide formal commentary and interpretation on financial information to stakeholders through variance analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare adhoc reports by gathering information from various sources and analyse and interpret the data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align reporting information to business changes by verifying and updating structural changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct (plan, consolidate, report) financial planning process which includes annual budget, 3-year plans and rolling forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare the monthly Opcom pack for the cluster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update monthly management account statements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor internal financial controls on a monthly basis and perform annual internal financial control reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that reporting deadlines are met by adhering to set deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep abreast of legislation and other industry changes that impacts on role by reading the relevant newletters, websites and attending sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and embrace the Nedbank vision and demonstrate the values through interaction with team and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve personal capability and stay abreast of developments in field of expertise by identifying training courses and career progression for self through input and feedback from managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure personal growth and enable effectiveness in performance of roles and responsibilities by ensuring all learning activities are completed, experience practiced and certifications obtained and/or maintained within specified time frames.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure information is provided correctly to stakeholders by maintaining knowledge sharing knowledge with team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a culture conducive to the achievement of transformation goals by participating in Nedbank Culture building initiatives by engaging in staff surveys etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate and support corporate social responsibility initiatives for the achievement of key business strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and recommend opportunities to enhance processes, systems and policies and support implementation of new processes, policies and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Our Ideal Candidate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a finance professional who demonstrates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A CA(SA) or CIMA qualification, coupled with strong financial management expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in budgeting, forecasting, financial reporting, and variance analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to translate data into actionable business insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills, with the confidence to engage at multiple levels of the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, results-driven mindset with a focus on accuracy, continuous improvement, and meeting deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Essential Qualifications - NQF Level&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0;margin-bottom:0.0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Matric / Grade 12 / National Senior Certificate&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Advanced Diplomas/National 1st Degrees&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Essential Qualification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&apos;s Degree, Advanced Diploma, or equivalent tertiary qualification in Finance, Accounting, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newly Qualified Chartered Accountant (CA(SA) or CIMA designation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Minimum Experience Level&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of experience in Financial Management, Financial Reporting, Management Accounting, or a related Finance function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Technical / Professional Knowledge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0;margin-bottom:0.0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Administrative procedures and systems&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Banking procedures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Cluster specific operations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Data analysis&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Governance, Risk and Controls&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Relevant regulatory knowledge&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Relevant software and systems knowledge&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Business writing skills&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Microsoft Excel&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Microsoft Powerpoint&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Behavioural Competencies&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0;margin-bottom:0.0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Building Customer Loyalty&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Communication&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Decision Making&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Initiating Action&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Managing Work&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Quality Orientation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:18.9px&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;228&quot; src=&quot;https://rmkcdn.successfactors.com/dd82a348/61ad7a3f-eb85-4980-a04c-e.jpg&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0px;width:600.0px&quot; width=&quot;245&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:18.9px&quot;&gt;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:18.9px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#006341&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;b&gt;Please contact the Nedbank Recruiting Team at +27 860 555 566 &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;img id=&quot;Picture_x0020_1&quot; src=&quot;https://rmkcdn.successfactors.com/dd82a348/461743ac-ca78-42fa-8634-a.png&quot; style=&quot;height:255.0px;width:600.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Job Purpose&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior AI engineering specialist with deep expertise in designing and scaling hyperscale cloud systems and advanced AI platforms. This role requires a strong foundation in distributed systems, machine learning, statistics, and big data ecosystems, combined with hands-on experience across modern AI frameworks and programming languages.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The successful candidate will play a critical role in architecting, deploying, and optimising AI systems powered by both small language models (SLMs) and large language models (LLMs), ensuring the right models and infrastructure are applied to each use case for optimal performance, scalability, and cost efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement scalable AI systems leveraging SLMs and LLMs embedding responsible AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select appropriate models based on use case, performance, and cost constraints, optimising value versus investment (FinOps for AI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop end-to-end architectures from data ingestion through to inference and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect solutions across cloud and on-premise environments using Kubernetes and modern cloud platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimise compute utilisation across CPU and GPU environments, including CUDA-based acceleration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and integrate pipelines using Apache Spark, Databricks, Kafka, PrestoDB, and Hadoop ecosystem tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable secure, governed, and scalable access to enterprise data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee model lifecycle management including deployment and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a subject matter expert and guide stakeholders on AI capabilities and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Critical Skills&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in distributed systems and hyperscale architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of machine learning, statistics, and AI system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python, C++, Java, Go, Rust (R advantageous).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GPU computing and CUDA optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with LLMs/SLMs and AI frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Kubernetes and cloud-native architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with big data platforms such as Spark, Databricks, Kafka, PrestoDB, Hadoop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and ability to translate technical concepts to business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualification&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Honours or Masters Degree (or higher) in either Information Systems or Computer Science&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Preferred Certifications&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;TOGAF Certification, Information Technology Architect Certification (ITAC) (Open Group)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Minimum Experience Level&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;5+ Years experience in developing strategic IT plans/roadmaps and&lt;br&gt;
10 Years in System design and development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Technical / Professional Knowledge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0;margin-bottom:0.0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;IT Infrastructure Architecture&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;TOGAF&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;System Development Life cycle(SDLC)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Computer Hardware &amp;amp; Software&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Operational frameworks (ITIL)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the broader IT domain and tactical IT requirements&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Specific technology of relevant to domain&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Behavioural Competencies&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0;margin-bottom:0.0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Global Perspective&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Strategic Planning&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Decision Making&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Customer Focus&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Adaptability&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Continuous Learning&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:18.9px&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;228&quot; src=&quot;https://rmkcdn.successfactors.com/dd82a348/61ad7a3f-eb85-4980-a04c-e.jpg&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0px;width:600.0px&quot; width=&quot;245&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:18.9px&quot;&gt;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:18.9px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#006341&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;b&gt;Please contact the Nedbank Recruiting Team at +27 860 555 566 &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;img id=&quot;Picture_x0020_1&quot; src=&quot;https://rmkcdn.successfactors.com/dd82a348/461743ac-ca78-42fa-8634-a.png&quot; style=&quot;height:255.0px;width:600.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:18.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Job Classification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Requisition: 146666&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA Specialist: Refilwe Falatsi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing Date: 27 July 2026&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Loc&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ation: Clocktower Campus, V&amp;amp;A Waterfront, Cape Town &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cluster: Personal and Private Banking | Nedbank Insurance | Operations |  Support Services - Loss Adjusters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Equity Statement: Preference will be given to applicants from Underrepresented Groups&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;FAIS Affected&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;FAIS Affected - Yes&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Job Purpose&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;To manage, control and attend to contractor audits, desktop and field assessments and enforce correct interpretation of the Nedbank Homeowners insurance policy with panel service providers and clients. Perform a mentoring and coaching support function to the Nedbank Insurance claims assessors and service providers on products and technical aspects where specialised knowledge is required in resolving intricate challenges regarding claims relevant to Homeowners insurance policy cover.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The types of claims dealt with include any building related claims such as burst geysers &amp;amp; pipes with resultant damage, storm damage to properties, flooring, interior cosmetic repairs to properties, electrical and electronic work etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validation of claims by means of underwriting, review of previous claims history and referencing and verifying the details of the insured peril as reported by the service provider in line with the relevant policy wording: Validation electronic equipment/ machinery breakdown claims and review reports from electrical SP’s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying what is required and outstanding from client. Comparing information collected to the policy requirements and claim details presented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determining equivalent replacement and determine risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantification and cost management in determining the scope of work compared to agreed rates on buildings related claims as well a ensuring visible damages are reflected on the mandatory photos from the insured or service provider Risk management, detect and identify fraudulent claims and any overcharging by clients and service providers. Perform risk management function by identifying underwriting risks and identifying inadequate Sum Insureds of dwellings for physical RCV where necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherence to all legislative requirements. Make balanced and informed decisions by identifying, analysing, interpreting, and applying relevant data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage cross functional relationships through consistent feedback on workflow progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mitigate risk through the application of technical skill by verifying, formulating and managing special conditions, sign-offs, consents and any other requests from the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Nedbank Insurance business by sharing Industry experiences and providing input on issues that impact bank and industry policies and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the achievement of the  business strategy, objectives and values by reviewing systems, process, services and ensure solutions are aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify training courses and career progression for self through input and feedback from management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all personal development plan activities are completed within specified timeframe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure professional conduct when dealing with all stakeholders through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge and industry trends with team and stakeholders during formal and informal interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure quality and accuracy of reports, pricing and workmanship rendered by service providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Job Responsibilities Continue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validation of claims according to the various insurance policies in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaising with clients, service providers, procurement, underwriting, FNOL, GFS and claims.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finalise all reports and administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making decisions, handle all administration and telephonic queries arising around that Quantification by either drafting a scope of work and finalizing the cost of the claim according to agreed rates or comparing quotations and reports received from service providers and clients compared to the scope of work and agreed rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing the cost from the start of the claim until the claim is finalized within the set parameters and agreed scope of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handling and resolving complaints and queries from clients, internal stakeholders as well as external stakeholders such as builders, engineers etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct all the above to the required performance and quality standards that are in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;People Specification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate should demonstrate the following:&lt;br&gt;•    A way of work that anticipates the requirements of various stakeholders when engaging through all mediums of communication&lt;br&gt;•    A passion for consensus-based decision making&lt;br&gt;•    The ability to deliver in a high-pressure, innovative environment&lt;br&gt;•    Curiosity and comfort with numbers and large data sets&lt;br&gt;•    A level of influence that creates buy-in and win-win outcomes with stakeholders&lt;br&gt;•    Excellent negotiation skills&lt;br&gt;•    The ability to engage at strategic, tactical and operational levels of the business&lt;br&gt;•    Excellent verbal and written interpersonal skills&lt;br&gt;•    Ownership of personal development&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Essential Qualifications - NQF Level&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0;margin-bottom:0.0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Matric / Grade 12 / National Senior Certificate&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Advanced Diplomas/National 1st Degrees&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualification&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc in Construction studies or BComm  – Quantity Surveying.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A tertiary qualification or significant progress towards obtaining any construction or built environment related qualification would be highly beneficial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FAIS Accreditation or a FAIS recognized qualification will be highly beneficial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Essential Certifications&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0;margin-bottom:0.0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;FAIS Regulatory Examination 1 qualification&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Minimum Experience Level&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4 years&apos; experience in loss adjusting, with strong technical knowledge of the buildings industry and the associated cost and workmanship variables.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building/ Electrical/ Machinery/ Breakdown claims experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Technical / Professional Knowledge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0;margin-bottom:0.0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Banking knowledge&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Business Acumen&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Data analysis&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Governance, Risk and Controls&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Industry trends&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Principles of financial management&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Principles of project management&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Relevant regulatory knowledge&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Relevant software and systems knowledge&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Decision-making process&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10.0px 0.0px;border:1.0px solid transparent&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16.0px;word-wrap:break-word&quot;&gt;&lt;H2 style=&quot;font-size:1.0em;margin:0.0px&quot;&gt;Behavioural Competencies&lt;/H2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0;margin-bottom:0.0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Building Partnerships&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Earning Trust&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Coaching&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Collaborating&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Decision Making&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Work Standards&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Leadership Disposition&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Planning and Organizing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:18.9px&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;228&quot; src=&quot;https://rmkcdn.successfactors.com/dd82a348/61ad7a3f-eb85-4980-a04c-e.jpg&quot; style=&quot;height:75.0px;width:600.0px&quot; width=&quot;245&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

